<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-City National started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-City National started.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth analyst Mark Morgan said  he started coverage of City National Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>Shares in the Beverly Hills, Calif.-based bank closed Friday off 1/8  at 28-5/8.</p>
<p>&quot;Private banking franchise makes this $4.7 billion bank an attractive  fundamental and longer-term takeover play,&quot; Morgan said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
